[style name="Interaction_Style"]
if {Astrid.ask_for_help} == 1:
	*A tree different from all the others. Its trunk is shaped to hold something.*
else:
	if {Malrik.Found_book} == true:
		join Magic_book (Open) center
		Magic_book (Open): Take 3x different coloured papilora flowers and blood of a ???? soul, mix it in a bowl and then eat it after a meal.
	elif {Malrik.Talked_already} == true:
		if {Malrik.Trusted_malric} == false:
			[signal arg="change_tree"]
			join Thorinn leftmost
			join Magic_book (Closed) center
			Thorinn (surprised): Well well well, look what we have here.
			Thorinn: This must be that all knowing book Malric was talking about.
			Magic_book (Open): Take 3x different coloured papilora flowers and blood of a ???? soul, mix it in a bowl and then eat it after a meal.
			Thorinn: Blood?! What kind of cure demands blood?
			Thorinn: It's the only option I've got. But is the price for salvation really worth it?
			set {Malrik.Found_book} = true
			[signal arg="Start_flower_quest"]
	else:
		Thorinn: That's odd, this wasn't here before. I probably shouldn't mess with it.
